            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have an opponent @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Once you get your hands on someone, it's hard for them to get away. Your opponent takes a –2 circumstance penalty to their next attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Escape] from being grabbed or restrained by you, and you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your AC against any attacks they make against you while you have them grabbed.</p>"
          },
